	(text "Watchdog: only a toggling BIAS_EN (10 kHz, 5 V) charges WST and turns Q203 on, which releases the clamps (CLAMP_WD low). Stopped high or low, card missing: CLAMP_WD = +15 V -> every channel clamped -> cold in about 130 ms. CLAMP_WD also clears the DAC (sheet 03)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
